sequenceDiagram
  participant Sender as External Sender
  participant HTTP as Odoo HTTP Controller
  participant Endpoint as Inbound Endpoint
  participant Backend as Connector Backend
  participant Event as Inbound Event
  participant Queue as Queue Worker

  Sender->>HTTP: POST webhook payload
  HTTP->>Endpoint: Resolve endpoint and verify signature
  Endpoint->>Event: Create event with endpoint reference
  Event->>Backend: Route to _handle_inbound_webhook_event

  alt Backend returns done
    Backend->>Event: Mark done
  else Backend returns retry
    Backend->>Queue: Schedule retry with delay
  else Backend returns dead_letter
    Backend->>Event: Mark dead_letter
  end
